OL,3,GNEWSA'Ship buster' missiles sink old US
OL,4,Awarship in live fire training off
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FA decommissioned American warship has
OL,8,Fbeen sunk off Scotland's west coast
OL,9,Fduring a training exercise involving
OL,10,Fboth US forces and the Royal Navy.
OL,12,FUSS Klakring was hit by missiles and a
OL,13,Ftorpedo before sinking in the North
OL,14,FAtlantic about 170 miles (274km) off
OL,15,Fthe Outer Hebrides last Monday.
OL,17,FThe US Navy said the ship went a
OL,18,Fthrough "rigorous" cleaning process
OL,19,Ffirst, and personnel checked for the
OL,20,Fpresence of whales and dolphins before
OL,21,Fthe live-firing exercise started.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
